# DApp.meme

Turn Any Token Into a Playable Onchain Ecosystem.

DApp.meme is a token-native DApp launchpad built on BNB Chain that enables anyone to instantly deploy interactive decentralized applications for any token.

Instead of limiting tokens to speculative trading, DApp.meme transforms them into participation-driven ecosystems through reusable DApp templates including:

* Onchain Games
* Prediction Markets
* PvP Systems
* Community Participation Apps
* Revenue-Sharing DApps

## Mobius DApp Protocol (MDP)

DApp.meme is powered by the Mobius DApp Protocol (MDP):

Token → DApp → Participation → Revenue → Liquidity → Token

MDP enables token communities to continuously generate interaction, utility, and ecosystem growth around their tokens.

## Features

* Deploy DApps for any token
* Multi-chain architecture
* Built for BNB Smart Chain (BSC)
* Supports future opBNB expansion
* Token-native participation systems
* Revenue-sharing mechanics
* Liquidity participation
* Creator fee systems
* Community-driven ecosystems

## Why DApp.meme?

Most launchpads stop at token creation.

DApp.meme focuses on what happens after launch.

Projects can:

* Promote not only token trading, but also their own playable DApps
* Generate ecosystem revenue from user participation
* Allow communities to participate as players or liquidity providers
* Extend the lifecycle and utility of existing tokens

## Ecosystem Vision

DApp.meme introduces a new “Meme DApp Ecosystem” category for BNB Chain, where tokens evolve into usable internet-native application ecosystems instead of remaining passive trading assets.

## Supported Ecosystem

* BNB Chain
* BNB Smart Chain (BSC)
* Ethereum
* Future multi-chain support

## Status

Live and actively expanding.

